{
  "description": "Confidence-interval capture engine — each draw samples n values, builds a confidence interval for the mean, and stacks it as a segment; intervals missing the true mean turn red while the running capture rate converges to the nominal confidence level, on a math-canvas. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
